## 八、常用命令速查

### Triton 侧

```bash
# 抓 Triton 中间 IR + autotuning 信息
TRITON_DEBUG=1 TRITON_ALWAYS_COMPILE=1 TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING=1 pytest test.py -s -v

# 日志里搜 dump 目录
# "Dumping intermediate results" → 进入 dump 目录拿 kernel.ttadapter.mlir
```

### 编译栈侧

```bash
# 全量 IR dump
bishengir-compile input.mlir --mlir-print-ir-before-all --mlir-print-ir-after-all > ir_dump.log 2>&1

# 更省：只在 IR 变化时打印
bishengir-compile --mlir-print-ir-after-change input.mlir > ir_dump.log 2>&1

# 按 Pass 分文件（适合二分）
bishengir-compile <flags> --mlir-print-ir-after-all \
  --mlir-print-ir-tree-dir=$(pwd)/bishengir_stages input.mlir 2>> a.log

# PlanMemory 内存用量
bishengir-opt input.mlir --hivm-plan-memory --hivm-plan-memory-enable-print-memory-allocated-size
```

### 性能分析

```bash
# 指令级仿真
msprof op simulator --output=<sim_dir> python run_B1.py

# 真机指令流水
msprof op --aic-metrics=InstrTimeline \
  --instr-timeline-pipe="cube|fixp|..." python <perf_script>

# 算子级调优（分 cube/vector/copy 三段看关键路径）
msprof op python <perf_script>
```

### 大 dump 里导航

```bash
grep -n "IR Dump After\|IR Dump Before" ir_dump.log           # 全部 Pass 边界
grep -n "TileAndBindSubBlock\|BubbleUpExtractSlice" ir_dump.log # 指定 Pass
grep -n "MayImplicitTransposeWithLastAxis" ir_dump.log          # 指定 annotation
grep -rn "%alloc_8\b" bishengir_stages/                        # 跟踪某个 SSA 值跨 Pass
for f in bishengir_stages/*.mlir; do echo "$f: $(grep -c MayImplicitTransposeWithLastAxis $f)"; done
```
